{"availability":"available","full":"yacobwood/BTCC","name":"BTCC","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2025-09-06T16:03:36Z","updated":"2026-10-08T23:04:12Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://btcc-ten.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://btcc-ten.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:42:59.379Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T23:42:59.379Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T23:42:59.379Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:42:59.379Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This is the authoritative technical reference for the BTCC Hub mobile application. It covers the product, architecture, data pipeline, backend services and operational processes end to end."],"features":["Applies last-known cached flags from AsyncStorage instantly (no network block)","Fetches fresh flags with an 8-second timeout, then applies global flags + per-device overrides","Per-device overrides are keyed by FCM token inside the overrides object in flags.json and are never cached.","The most complex store. Manages all user notification preferences and FCM topic subscriptions.","Every setSetting() call triggers syncAllTopics(), which subscribes or unsubscribes from each FCM topic based on the full PARENTCHAIN hierarchy. A leaf topic is only subscribed when its own value AND all parent values…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/yacobwood/BTCC/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"2f3aa0b5863849988612785cd5feff04ad390cafa244a7293b7aeff970764807","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T23:42:59.676Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:42:59.676Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This is the authoritative technical reference for the BTCC Hub mobile application. It covers the product, architecture, data pipeline, backend services and operational processes end to end.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/yacobwood/BTCC/blo