od/BTCC/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"required","text":"Every scraper workflow auto-retries once before alerting (added 2026-09-01 for the 5 btcc.net-facing workflows, originally to cut noise from self-hosted-runner contention, kept after the Scrapfly migration since a transient Scrapfly/parse blip deserves the same treatment; extended 2026-09-06 to race-day-start.yml, scrape-penalties.yml and scrape-youtube.yml, which previously…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/yacobwood/BTCC/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"2f3aa0b5863849988612785cd5feff04ad390cafa244a7293b7aeff970764807","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/yacobwood/BTCC/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T23:42:59.678Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T23:04:12Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/yacobwood/BTCC/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T23:42:59.693Z","hash":"2f3aa0b5863849988612785cd5feff04ad390cafa244a7293b7aeff970764807","originalBytes":292891,"storedBytes":292891,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["own","same","every","only","one","race","live","src","driver","article","rather","via","real","data","already","page","app","both","image","results","since","never","when","each","see","round","team","before","scrape","now","fixed","car","confirmed","notification","still","which","just","tab","fetch","name","new","run","btcc.net","grid","session","once","two","added","after","instead","screens","any","day","had","per","above","news","used","first","lap","photo","user","actually","full","screen","chat","file","year","articles","admin","state","ever","minutes","card","number","other","api","gallery","device","android","directly","github","their","button","content","json","store","drivers","failure","url","entry","fallback","hub","retry","scraper","read","back","below","btcc","nothing","points","qualifying","season","silently","title","current","functions","slug","true","workflow","against","e.g.","fix","itself","shows","si